WEBVTT

00:00:02.730 --> 00:00:03.650
<i>Maa-kun.</i>

00:00:04.320 --> 00:00:05.320
<i>Maa-kun!?</i>

00:00:05.650 --> 00:00:06.740
<i>A man?</i>

00:00:07.490 --> 00:00:09.070
<i>Huh? I thought she hated men!</i>

00:00:09.860 --> 00:00:11.990
<i>Don't tell me he's her ex!</i>

00:01:44.130 --> 00:01:46.340
Her brother is here to pick her up.

00:01:46.340 --> 00:01:47.000
Come in.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:49.550
Excuse me.

00:01:52.260 --> 00:01:54.840
She should wake up soon.

00:01:55.930 --> 00:01:58.720
Mari, you okay? Mari.

00:01:59.020 --> 00:02:01.480
<i>Spitting Woman's... older brother?</i>

00:02:03.900 --> 00:02:06.480
Oh, you're awake. Let's get you home.

00:02:06.810 --> 00:02:08.730
Up you go, Mari, hang on tight.

00:02:11.900 --> 00:02:13.570
Thank you for taking care of her.

00:02:13.570 --> 00:02:15.110
Of course. You take care now.

00:02:15.110 --> 00:02:16.910
Oh, wait. You, too.

00:02:17.200 --> 00:02:19.240
Um... You're Mari's boyfriend?

00:02:19.240 --> 00:02:20.330
Yeah, I am!

00:02:20.330 --> 00:02:21.580
I knew it!

00:02:21.580 --> 00:02:22.460
He's not.

00:02:22.460 --> 00:02:24.460
<i>Urk, she heard that.</i>

00:02:24.460 --> 00:02:27.500
Matsunaga-kun carried her here.

00:02:27.500 --> 00:02:28.750
Oh, I see!

00:02:29.210 --> 00:02:31.050
Thanks, Matsunaga-kun.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:32.170
No problem.

00:02:32.630 --> 00:02:34.430
Okay, we'll be going.

00:02:34.430 --> 00:02:35.340
Sorry for the trouble.

00:02:37.260 --> 00:02:39.850
Was Tsutsui-san okay?

00:02:39.850 --> 00:02:41.930
That was pretty responsible of you, Mattsun.

00:02:42.180 --> 00:02:43.690
Oh?

00:02:43.690 --> 00:02:45.600
Natsuki, there's Kobayakawa-san.

00:02:45.850 --> 00:02:47.060
You're right!

00:02:47.060 --> 00:02:47.860
Kobayakawa-san!

00:02:48.900 --> 00:02:49.770
Hashiba-kun.

00:02:50.270 --> 00:02:51.610
You played well today.

00:02:51.610 --> 00:02:52.650
Heading home?

00:02:52.650 --> 00:02:53.360
Yeah.

00:02:55.530 --> 00:03:00.410
Um, Matsunaga-kun, thank you
for carrying Mari-chan earlier.

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:02.750
Hey, no need to thank me.

00:03:02.750 --> 00:03:05.160
Looks like you're in a hurry.
Checking on Spitting Woman?

00:03:05.160 --> 00:03:05.870
Yeah.

00:03:05.870 --> 00:03:09.670
She lives near Yamagishi Station,
so I thought I'd bike there before work.

00:03:09.670 --> 00:03:10.880
Can I come along?

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:13.630
Uh... but it's to her home...

00:03:13.630 --> 00:03:14.840
I'd have to ask her first.

00:03:14.840 --> 00:03:16.050
Sure, ask away.

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:22.930
Sorry.

00:03:24.480 --> 00:03:27.150
Maybe I should just drop by uninvited...

00:03:27.150 --> 00:03:29.230
<i>Oh, but I don't know where she lives.</i>

00:03:29.230 --> 00:03:31.650
I've always thought...

00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:37.780
...that while you and Mari-chan fight,
you seem to get along well.

00:03:37.780 --> 00:03:38.820
Still...

00:03:39.620 --> 00:03:43.160
If you're not actually serious
about her, leave her alone.

00:03:45.460 --> 00:03:46.960
Aside from that...

00:03:46.960 --> 00:03:50.500
Um, if you have a message for her,
I could pass it along.

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:53.710
I don't, so... nevermind.

00:03:53.710 --> 00:03:54.800
No?

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:55.880
I'll see you later, then.

00:03:57.090 --> 00:03:58.300
Mattsun!

00:03:58.720 --> 00:04:01.010
No fair! You're the only one
who got to talk to her!

00:04:01.010 --> 00:04:02.350
Sorry, my bad.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:07.850
<i>It seems like the best friend of the girl
I like doesn't trust me anymore.</i>

00:04:08.900 --> 00:04:11.770
<i>I could've just said "I am serious", but...</i>

00:04:11.770 --> 00:04:14.190
<i>I want Spitting Woman to be the first to hear it.</i>

00:04:14.730 --> 00:04:16.110
What'll we do today?

00:04:16.110 --> 00:04:18.910
Well, I'm going to swing
by Yamagishi for a while.

00:04:18.910 --> 00:04:22.070
Oh, visiting one of your old flames?

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:25.330
No. I'm checking on Spitting Woman.

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:28.000
Didn't she say you couldn't?

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:29.540
Well, yeah, but...

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:31.250
I've got something I want to tell her.

00:04:32.250 --> 00:04:33.420
Like what?

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:37.630
Like, maybe a love confession?

00:04:37.630 --> 00:04:38.340
Just kidding.

00:04:40.470 --> 00:04:42.930
T-Take care!

00:04:42.930 --> 00:04:43.720
Yeah.

00:04:43.720 --> 00:04:45.890
<i>I want her to know what's happened.</i>

00:04:45.890 --> 00:04:48.270
<i>I don't want to let her
go on misunderstanding.</i>

00:04:48.270 --> 00:04:52.770
<i>I'd never have gone out
of my way like this before...</i>

00:04:55.020 --> 00:04:55.690
<i>Now then...</i>

00:04:56.150 --> 00:04:59.070
<i>Where do I even start?</i>

00:05:00.490 --> 00:05:02.160
<i>Kobayakawa-san spotted!</i>

00:05:02.490 --> 00:05:04.080
<i>She came out of there!</i>

00:05:04.780 --> 00:05:06.370
<i>Is this the place?</i>

00:05:11.170 --> 00:05:13.040
Anna, did you forget—

00:05:13.040 --> 00:05:15.630
Hey there!
Wow, you're looking much—

00:05:17.510 --> 00:05:19.510
Hey! Don't close it!

00:05:19.510 --> 00:05:21.590
Shut up!
What'd you come here for?

00:05:21.590 --> 00:05:22.430
Buzz off!

00:05:22.430 --> 00:05:24.010
What do you mean, "what"?!

00:05:24.010 --> 00:05:27.430
You're disturbing the neighbors! Go away!

00:05:27.430 --> 00:05:29.100
If so, then let me in!

00:05:29.100 --> 00:05:31.390
Are you nuts?! You're so shameless!

00:05:31.390 --> 00:05:31.980
Hey!

00:05:32.310 --> 00:05:34.690
Dammit! You locked it and put the chain on?!

00:05:34.690 --> 00:05:36.110
Well, good night!

00:05:37.400 --> 00:05:40.530
<i>Crap, she won't even talk to me.</i>

00:05:40.530 --> 00:05:41.490
Huh?

00:05:42.150 --> 00:05:45.370
Hey... Matsunaga-kun, was it?

00:05:45.700 --> 00:05:46.620
Oh, hey.

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:49.120
Thanks a lot for your help earlier.

00:05:49.120 --> 00:05:50.960
So, what's up?

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:52.580
What're you doing here?

00:05:52.580 --> 00:05:55.710
I came to check how she's doing,
but... she won't let me in.

00:05:55.710 --> 00:05:57.340
Oh, I see!

00:05:57.340 --> 00:05:58.800
I'll let you in, then.

00:05:59.130 --> 00:06:00.760
But the chain's on.

00:06:00.760 --> 00:06:02.470
Whoa! Seriously?!

00:06:02.470 --> 00:06:03.630
Hey!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:05.390
Mari! Mari!

00:06:06.430 --> 00:06:07.310
Hey!

00:06:07.760 --> 00:06:11.560
She must've gone to sleep!
Once she lies down, she's out like a light!

00:06:11.560 --> 00:06:12.890
<i>Seriously?</i>

00:06:12.890 --> 00:06:14.480
<i>That's so cute.</i>

00:06:15.100 --> 00:06:18.770
Now what... I'd rather not just
leave this for her and go home...

00:06:18.770 --> 00:06:19.780
Oh?

00:06:19.780 --> 00:06:21.280
You don't live together?

00:06:21.280 --> 00:06:23.490
Nah. Since I'm married.

00:06:23.490 --> 00:06:25.160
Huh? You're married?

00:06:25.570 --> 00:06:26.490
Yeah.

00:06:26.490 --> 00:06:29.080
I started working as soon
as I graduated high school.

00:06:29.080 --> 00:06:32.540
Mari would've been in her
third year of middle school then.

00:06:32.540 --> 00:06:34.460
Since around then...

00:06:35.750 --> 00:06:38.130
...she's been in a rebellious phase.

00:06:38.130 --> 00:06:41.090
She's always so prickly, it's scary!

00:06:41.090 --> 00:06:41.960
Huh?

00:06:41.960 --> 00:06:43.720
I have a kid sister, too.

00:06:43.720 --> 00:06:44.930
Don't tell me...

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:46.590
Yep, they grow independent from you.

00:06:46.590 --> 00:06:48.140
Shoot! That's so lonely!

00:06:48.140 --> 00:06:49.890
Yeah, I feel you there.

00:06:51.220 --> 00:06:52.680
<i>I fell asleep?</i>

00:06:54.640 --> 00:06:56.400
<i>That guy's still here?</i>

00:06:58.150 --> 00:07:00.820
Say, how's Mari? At school I mean.

00:07:01.860 --> 00:07:04.820
Getting along with her friends?

00:07:04.820 --> 00:07:06.700
Sometimes a little violently.

00:07:06.700 --> 00:07:08.740
So she's prickly at school too, huh?

00:07:08.740 --> 00:07:11.040
Guess that's just how Mari is.

00:07:11.040 --> 00:07:13.660
Still, let me tell you
something as her brother.

00:07:13.660 --> 00:07:18.000
She always used to call me "Maa-kun"
and follow me everywhere.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:21.800
She was a very docile and adorable little sister.

00:07:21.800 --> 00:07:25.010
Yet now, though it's ages since
I've been by, she glares at me.

00:07:25.010 --> 00:07:28.220
I guess that means she hates me now.

00:07:29.050 --> 00:07:31.680
She called you "Maa-kun"...?

00:07:31.680 --> 00:07:33.430
Since my name's Masaomi!

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:38.440
There was a time when she
kept saying she'd marry me.

00:07:38.440 --> 00:07:40.020
It was so cute.

00:07:46.150 --> 00:07:47.570
So, how about you?

00:07:47.910 --> 00:07:48.700
Huh?

00:07:48.700 --> 00:07:51.240
You're not her boyfriend,
yet you came to check on her.

00:07:51.660 --> 00:07:54.370
Well, it's because I'm after her, obviously.

00:07:54.370 --> 00:07:55.500
I figured!

00:07:55.870 --> 00:07:58.420
But it's not going well.

00:07:58.870 --> 00:08:01.790
Up until now I've fooled around a lot,

00:08:01.790 --> 00:08:03.340
so she doesn't trust me at all.

00:08:03.840 --> 00:08:08.260
I try to think about how to get her
to notice me, but it's difficult.

00:08:08.970 --> 00:08:13.180
I never expected falling in love
for real would be this hard.

00:08:16.600 --> 00:08:19.690
Ha, you're so green! Like a student!

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:21.150
Well, I am in high school.

00:08:21.150 --> 00:08:23.860
Anyway, if you're serious
about her, it'll be fine.

00:08:23.860 --> 00:08:25.740
But if not, I'll be mad too.

00:08:25.740 --> 00:08:26.440
Right...

00:08:27.450 --> 00:08:29.950
Our parents both had to work.

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:32.910
So I was always looking after her.

00:08:32.910 --> 00:08:36.620
But since I spoiled her rotten,
she may be a bit selfish as a result.

00:08:37.330 --> 00:08:40.670
But once she trusts someone,
she's totally open with them.

00:08:40.670 --> 00:08:42.290
She's a good kid who cares about others.

00:08:42.880 --> 00:08:45.250
I can see that.

00:08:45.920 --> 00:08:47.760
She's very devoted.

00:08:47.760 --> 00:08:49.430
I think that's one of her good points.

00:08:49.840 --> 00:08:52.930
Well, but that's also why
I'm making hardly any progress.

00:08:52.930 --> 00:08:55.930
There's too much of a gap
between me and my rival.

00:08:55.930 --> 00:08:58.390
Oh, you've got a rival, huh?

00:08:58.390 --> 00:08:59.480
That's tough.

00:08:59.770 --> 00:09:01.900
Honestly, I'm fighting a losing battle.

00:09:02.230 --> 00:09:04.020
That's just how love is.

00:09:04.980 --> 00:09:07.230
Keep it up.
I'll toss some support your way.

00:09:07.230 --> 00:09:08.240
Toss?

00:09:08.860 --> 00:09:10.360
Uh-oh, I'd better get going.

00:09:10.360 --> 00:09:11.950
The wife's waiting.

00:09:11.950 --> 00:09:13.450
Oh, how about you?

00:09:13.450 --> 00:09:15.080
I have a car, I could drop you off.

00:09:15.080 --> 00:09:16.660
Nah, I'll be fine.

00:09:19.040 --> 00:09:20.120
Later!

00:09:29.090 --> 00:09:30.380
...Ugh.

00:09:34.300 --> 00:09:35.680
Hello?

00:09:36.430 --> 00:09:37.930
Oh, Spitting Woman!

00:09:37.930 --> 00:09:39.430
Were you sleeping?

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:40.390
Yeah.

00:09:40.390 --> 00:09:41.560
How are you feeling?

00:09:41.560 --> 00:09:42.980
You okay?

00:09:42.980 --> 00:09:43.520
Sorta.

00:09:44.360 --> 00:09:45.940
Did you need something?

00:09:45.940 --> 00:09:48.440
Well, sort of...

00:09:48.440 --> 00:09:49.740
Could you come out for a bit?

00:09:49.740 --> 00:09:51.240
No. It's cold.

00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:52.490
Yeah, figures.

00:09:52.860 --> 00:09:55.410
Well, sorry to tell you this
over the phone, then.

00:09:56.450 --> 00:10:00.080
I honestly do love you.

00:10:00.870 --> 00:10:02.210
Even if you hate me.

00:10:03.000 --> 00:10:05.040
I'd at least like you to know that.

00:10:09.460 --> 00:10:12.680
I know this isn't what you want to hear,

00:10:12.680 --> 00:10:18.720
but it was starting to hurt
that you didn't know how I felt.

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:19.520
I know...

00:10:19.520 --> 00:10:20.140
Huh?

00:10:20.140 --> 00:10:21.850
I said, "I know!"

00:10:21.850 --> 00:10:22.430
Huh?!

00:10:22.430 --> 00:10:23.980
You're right there?

00:10:23.980 --> 00:10:25.350
I just got to the door!

00:10:27.860 --> 00:10:30.070
But I love Anna...

00:10:30.860 --> 00:10:32.530
And I hate men...

00:10:32.530 --> 00:10:34.410
And I keep telling you you're creepy!

00:10:35.070 --> 00:10:36.620
You make no sense.

00:10:36.620 --> 00:10:37.830
It's giving me a headache.

00:10:39.910 --> 00:10:40.490
Sorry.

00:10:45.250 --> 00:10:47.130
Well, take care of yourself.

00:10:47.130 --> 00:10:49.210
I'll practice basketball with you sometime.

00:10:49.210 --> 00:10:50.250
No thanks.

00:10:52.760 --> 00:10:53.970
<i>I'm sure...</i>

00:10:54.380 --> 00:10:58.510
<i>...her brother's probably
the reason she hates men.</i>

00:10:59.050 --> 00:11:01.970
<i>But, for now, I won't press her.</i>

00:11:06.980 --> 00:11:10.230
<i>I'll wait until she chooses to talk about it.</i>

00:11:13.780 --> 00:11:15.610
<i>I may not look it,</i>

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:18.570
<i>but I'm really a patient man.</i>

00:11:25.500 --> 00:11:29.460
<i>But I'm in love with Anna...</i>
